			title: "Builder's Lab: The Orientation Wall"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1C89C8BFA7B44BF7"]
			description: [
				"Search at-supplementaries in JEI and select a notice board, signpost, jar, pedestal, clock, globe, and one redstone-aware block. Learn what each communicates or stores before choosing where it belongs."
				"Use notice boards for written information, signposts for destinations, and display blocks for objects with context. Interactive pieces deserve access space and should not be buried inside a decorative wall."
				"Build a small traveller's corner where at least three pieces have genuine jobs. The mod feels most vanilla when objects answer needs the base already has rather than appearing as random catalogue clutter."
			]
			id: "363AD2B472037687"
			rewards: [{
