			title: "Builder's Lab: Useful Supplementaries"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["363AD2B472037687"]
			description: [
				"Search at-quark in JEI and browse by use rather than crafting everything. Quark deliberately groups many optional vanilla-style ideas across building, automation, management, and world details."
				"Choose one block family, one storage or redstone convenience, and one decorative interaction. Test each in a sample area so later discoveries can be recognised as Quark rather than mistaken for a broken vanilla mechanic."
				"Record only features that are actually enabled in this installed version and configuration. Online lists cover many Minecraft versions, so the in-game recipe index and observed behaviour remain the final authority."
			]
			id: "2F94DD73DC9FE4E0"
			rewards: [{
				id: "3588B2C0756D81FC"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			subtitle: "A toolbox of small features, not one tech tree"
