			title: "Builder's Lab: Survey Quark"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2F94DD73DC9FE4E0"]
			description: [
				"Use Rechiseled to exchange a base material for a coordinated decorative texture and preview whether the variant uses connected textures. Strong patterns usually belong on borders, floors, foundations, or one feature plane."
				"Use FramedBlocks for slopes and unusual geometry, then apply the desired camouflage material. A Framed Hammer can remove a camouflage when the experiment goes wrong; learn recovery before building at roof height."
				"Create Copycats perform a similar visual role around kinetic builds. Keep the outline readable and leave machine interfaces exposed, because texture continuity is not worth hiding the block another player must click."
			]
			id: "147D8611B8A5F18F"
			rewards: [{
