		{
			dependencies: ["147D8611B8A5F18F"]
			description: [
				"Place a sample strip of exposed and sheltered materials from Immersive Weathering and the vanilla copper family. Observe environmental change before selecting the final state for a large public build."
				"Weathering can make foundations, paths, roofs, and abandoned corners tell time, but accidental change can also break a strict palette. Store reference blocks and learn the available preservation or reversal recipes in JEI."
				"Mark truly ruined sites as history instead of automatically polishing everything. The settlement should show which places are maintained, which are old, and which were deliberately left for future explorers to interpret."
			]
			id: "2C81ECFD15A06163"
			rewards: [{
