		{
			dependencies: ["2C81ECFD15A06163"]
			description: [
				"Choose a foundation, main wall, roof pitch, window rhythm, lantern style, path edge, and two accent materials for one district. Build a sample facade before spending the whole server's supply."
				"Allow individual furniture and details while repeating the larger language. Handcrafted, Another Furniture, Beautify, Macaw's families, Twigs, Woodworks, and Decorative Blocks should support the room's purpose."
				"Publish the palette and placement samples in a builder's yard with spare materials beside them. The exercise completes when another player can add a distinct building that still looks as if it belongs to the same settlement."
